              "abstractOriginal": "We study a finite-width two-dimensional quantum ring with a quadratic $d$-wave altermagnetic term, Tan--Inkson confinement, a perpendicular magnetic field, and independently tunable Aharonov--Bohm (AB) flux. The altermagnetic interaction mixes $m$ and $m\\pm2$ angular channels while preserving their parity. Circular symmetry renders the crystal orientation spectrally irrelevant and makes the two spin blocks exactly isospectral. The resulting same-parity anticrossings are resolved at low filling, and multichannel mixing is found near the Fermi level of highly occupied rings. Independent converged calculations for $N_e=1400$ and $1800$ establish the reconstructed Fermi edge and magnetic response in a finite field window and the persistent current over a full AB flux period. The analytic conventional reference separates radial-subband depopulation (dHvA-type cycles) from finer finite-ring shell oscillations; we do not assign a global Fourier spectrum to unverified altermagnetic field scans. The few-electron thermal response is obtained from an exact fixed-particle-number canonical partition function, avoiding finite-system errors of a fixed-mean-number approximation. The circular model supports an equilibrium charge current but no persistent spin current.",
              "abstractZh": "我们研究了一个有限宽度的二维量子环，具有二次 $d$ 波交变磁项、Tan-Inkson 约束、垂直磁场和独立可调的 Aharonov-Bohm (AB) 通量。交变磁相互作用混合了 $m$ 和 $m\\pm2$ 角通道，同时保留了它们的奇偶性。圆对称性使得晶体取向在光谱上无关，并使两个自旋块完全等光谱。由此产生的同宇称反交叉在低填充下得到解决，并且在高占据环的费米能级附近发现多通道混合。 $N_e=1400$ 和 $1800$ 的独立收敛计算建立了有限场窗口中的重建费米边缘和磁响应以及整个 AB 磁通周期内的持续电流。解析传统参考将径向子带减少（dHvA 型循环）与更精细的有限环壳振荡分开；我们不会为未经验证的交变磁场扫描分配全局傅里叶谱。 少电子热响应是从精确的固定粒子数正则配分函数获得的，避免了固定平均数近似的有限系统误差。圆形模型支持平衡充电电流，但不支持持续自旋电流。",
              "articleSummary": "We study a finite-width two-dimensional quantum ring with a quadratic $d$-wave altermagnetic term, Tan--Inkson confinement, a perpendicular magnetic field, and independently tunable Aharonov--Bohm (AB) flux. The altermagnetic interaction mixes $m$ and $m\\pm2$ angular channels while preserving their parity. Circular symmetry renders the crystal orientation spectrally irrelevant and makes the two spin blocks exactly isospectral. The resulting same-parity anticrossings are resolved at low filling, and multichannel mixing is found near the Fermi level of highly occupied rings. Independent converged calculations for $N_e=1400$ and $1800$ establish the reconstructed Fermi edge and magnetic response in a finite field window and the persistent current over a full AB flux period. The analytic conventional reference separates radial-subband depopulation (dHvA-type cycles) from finer finite-ring shell oscillations; we do not assign a global Fourier spectrum to unverified altermagnetic field scans. The few-electron thermal response is obtained from an exact fixed-particle-number canonical partition function, avoiding finite-system errors of a fixed-mean-number approximation. The circular model supports an equilibrium charge current but no persistent spin current.",
              "articleSummaryZh": "我们研究了一个有限宽度的二维量子环，具有二次 $d$ 波交变磁项、Tan-Inkson 约束、垂直磁场和独立可调的 Aharonov-Bohm (AB) 通量。交变磁相互作用混合了 $m$ 和 $m\\pm2$ 角通道，同时保留了它们的奇偶性。圆对称性使得晶体取向在光谱上无关，并使两个自旋块完全等光谱。由此产生的同宇称反交叉在低填充下得到解决，并且在高占据环的费米能级附近发现多通道混合。 $N_e=1400$ 和 $1800$ 的独立收敛计算建立了有限场窗口中的重建费米边缘和磁响应以及整个 AB 磁通周期内的持续电流。解析传统参考将径向子带减少（dHvA 型循环）与更精细的有限环壳振荡分开；我们不会为未经验证的交变磁场扫描分配全局傅里叶谱。 少电子热响应是从精确的固定粒子数正则配分函数获得的，避免了固定平均数近似的有限系统误差。圆形模型支持平衡充电电流，但不支持持续自旋电流。",
              "discussionFocus": "重点围绕 altermagnetic、altermagnet 展开。 We study a finite-width two-dimensional quantum ring with a quadratic $d$-wave altermagnetic term, Tan--Inkson confinement, a perpendicular magnetic field, and independently tunable Aharonov--Bohm (AB) flux.",
              "discussionFocusZh": "我们研究了一个有限宽度的二维量子环，具有二次 $d$ 波交变磁项、Tan-Inkson 约束、垂直磁场和独立可调的 Aharonov-Bohm (AB) 通量。圆形模型支持平衡充电电流，但不支持持续自旋电流。 结合关键词看，阅读时应重点关注交变磁性相关的交变磁性的对称性来源、动量空间自旋劈裂，以及这些特征如何影响输运、光学或磁动力学响应。"
