          "abstractOriginal": "In covalent organic frameworks (COFs), the geometry of the building units predetermines the structure of the framework, yet comparable design principles relating the COF linkers to the local motions that govern guest adsorption and diffusion as well as mechanical response have remained beyond reach. Here, we combine synchrotron X-ray pair distribution function (PDF) analysis with molecular dynamics (MD) simulations accelerated by machine learning interatomic potentials to resolve and compare the local dynamics of two three-dimensional imine-linked COFs, chosen to differ in the geometry and rigidity of one of their two building units. Both are constructed from the same 4-connected square planar linker, $4,4',4'',4'''$-(pyrene-1,3,6,8-tetrayl)tetraaniline (PyTTA), reticulated with the 12-connected nanographene hexakis{[3,5-bis($p$-formylphenyl)-4,6-dimethoxyphenyl]}hexabenzocoronene to give COF-412, {[(HBC-LA$_{12}$)(PyTTA)$_3$]}$_{\\mathit{imine}}$, and with the 6-connected triptycene 2,3,6,7,14,15-hexakis(4-formylphenyl)triptycene to give COF-564, {[(Trip-CHO)$_2$(PyTTA)$_3$]}$_{\\mathit{imine}}$. The PDF-MD approach resolves the amplitude, the time scale, and the spatial extent of the motion of all COF linkers, separating the limited libration of the fused aromatic cores from the larger reorientational tilts of the pendant aryl rings they carry and from the translation of whole linkers within the net. The simulations further reveal that exchanging the nanographene- for the triptycene-based linker tunes the equilibrium tilt and the positional probability density of PyTTA, raising the tilt amplitude of its linker partner, and, notably, strengthens the coupling between the translations of neighbouring linkers. This approach provides a blueprint for understanding local dynamical properties in COFs, and shows them to be selectable through the choice of building unit and amenable to design.",
          "abstractZh": "在共价有机框架（COF）中，构建单元的几何形状预先决定了框架的结构，但将COF连接体与控制客体吸附和扩散以及机械响应的局部运动相关的可比较的设计原理仍然遥不可及。 在这里，我们将同步加速器 X 射线对分布函数 (PDF) 分析与机器学习原子间势加速的分子动力学 (MD) 模拟相结合，以解析和比较两个三维亚胺连接 COF 的局部动力学，这两个结构单元的几何形状和刚性不同。 两者均由相同的 4 连接的方形平面连接体 $4,4',4'',4'''$-(pyrene-1,3,6,8-tetrayl)tetraaniline (PyTTA) 构成，并与 12 连接的纳米石墨烯六基{[3,5-双($p$-甲酰基苯基)-4,6-二甲氧基苯基]}六苯并晕形成网状COF-412，{[(HBC-LA$_{12}$)(PyTTA)$_3$]}$_{\\mathit{imine}}$，并与6-连接的三蝶烯2,3,6,7,14,15-六(4-甲酰基苯基)三蝶烯得到COF-564， {[(Trip-CHO)$_2$(PyTTA)$_3$]}$_{\\mathit{亚胺}}$。 PDF-MD方法解析了所有COF连接体运动的幅度、时间尺度和空间范围，将稠合芳族核的有限解放与它们携带的悬垂芳环的较大重新取向倾斜以及网络内整个连接体的平移分开。",
          "articleSummary": "In covalent organic frameworks (COFs), the geometry of the building units predetermines the structure of the framework, yet comparable design principles relating the COF linkers to the local motions that govern guest adsorption and diffusion as well as mechanical response have remained beyond reach. Here, we combine synchrotron X-ray pair distribution function (PDF) analysis with molecular dynamics (MD) simulations accelerated by machine learning interatomic potentials to resolve and compare the local dynamics of two three-dimensional imine-linked COFs, chosen to differ in the geometry and rigidity of one of their two building units. Both are constructed from the same 4-connected square planar linker, $4,4',4'',4'''$-(pyrene-1,3,6,8-tetrayl)tetraaniline (PyTTA), reticulated with the 12-connected nanographene hexakis{[3,5-bis($p$-formylphenyl)-4,6-dimethoxyphenyl]}hexabenzocoronene to give COF-412, {[(HBC-LA$_{12}$)(PyTTA)$_3$]}$_{\\mathit{imine}}$, and with the 6-connected triptycene 2,3,6,7,14,15-hexakis(4-formylphenyl)triptycene to give COF-564, {[(Trip-CHO)$_2$(PyTTA)$_3$]}$_{\\mathit{imine}}$. The PDF-MD approach resolves the amplitude, the time scale, and the spatial extent of the motion of all COF linkers, separating the limited libration of the fused aromatic cores from the larger reorientational tilts of the pendant aryl rings they carry and from the translation of whole linkers within the net. The simulations further reveal that exchanging the nanographene- for the triptycene-based linker tunes the equilibrium tilt and the positional probability density of PyTTA, raising the tilt amplitude of its linker partner, and, notably, strengthens the coupling between the translations of neighbouring linkers. This approach provides a blueprint for understanding local dynamical properties in COFs, and shows them to be selectable through the choice of building unit and amenable to design.",
          "articleSummaryZh": "在共价有机框架（COF）中，构建单元的几何形状预先决定了框架的结构，但将COF连接体与控制客体吸附和扩散以及机械响应的局部运动相关的可比较的设计原理仍然遥不可及。 在这里，我们将同步加速器 X 射线对分布函数 (PDF) 分析与机器学习原子间势加速的分子动力学 (MD) 模拟相结合，以解析和比较两个三维亚胺连接 COF 的局部动力学，这两个结构单元的几何形状和刚性不同。 两者均由相同的 4 连接的方形平面连接体 $4,4',4'',4'''$-(pyrene-1,3,6,8-tetrayl)tetraaniline (PyTTA) 构成，并与 12 连接的纳米石墨烯六基{[3,5-双($p$-甲酰基苯基)-4,6-二甲氧基苯基]}六苯并晕形成网状COF-412，{[(HBC-LA$_{12}$)(PyTTA)$_3$]}$_{\\mathit{imine}}$，并与6-连接的三蝶烯2,3,6,7,14,15-六(4-甲酰基苯基)三蝶烯得到COF-564， {[(Trip-CHO)$_2$(PyTTA)$_3$]}$_{\\mathit{亚胺}}$。 PDF-MD方法解析了所有COF连接体运动的幅度、时间尺度和空间范围，将稠合芳族核的有限解放与它们携带的悬垂芳环的较大重新取向倾斜以及网络内整个连接体的平移分开。",
          "discussionFocus": "重点围绕 machine learning interatomic potential 展开。 In covalent organic frameworks (COFs), the geometry of the building units predetermines the structure of the framework, yet comparable design principles relating the COF linkers to the local motions that govern guest adsorption and diffusion as well as mechanical response have remained beyond reach.",
          "discussionFocusZh": "在共价有机框架（COF）中，构建单元的几何形状预先决定了框架的结构，但将COF连接体与控制客体吸附和扩散以及机械响应的局部运动相关的可比较的设计原理仍然遥不可及。 在这里，我们将同步加速器 X 射线对分布函数 (PDF) 分析与机器学习原子间势加速的分子动力学 (MD) 模拟相结合，以解析和比较两个三维亚胺连接 COF 的局部动力学，这两个结构单元的几何形状和刚性不同。 结合关键词看，阅读时应重点关注机器学习原子间势相关的基准数据集、评价指标、误差来源，以及不同模型在精度、效率和可迁移性之间的取舍。"
