              "abstractZh": "QUERY LENGTH LIMIT EXCEEDED. MAX ALLOWED QUERY : 500 CHARS 在这里，我们通过将远程静电力和天然有效电荷（ BEC ）分析性地分离成全局静电计算和已知潜在电荷的严格局部导数来克服这一局限性。该配方保留了等变MLIP的空间可分解性，同时允许在不同边界条件下对能量、力、应力和BEC进行分布式评估。 该框架在\\ texttt {nvalchemi}平台上实现为DPA4C-LR ，在四个GPU上扩展到520万个原子，其计算成本大约是其短程骨干网的两倍。经过能量和力的训练， DPA4C-LR准确地推断出BEC ，并再现了水的场相关红外光谱。 我们进一步展示了它的能力，恢复了松弛体\\ ce {Pb (Mg_{1/3} Nb_{2/3}) O3}的特征极化迟滞，这种迟滞在较小的模拟中被有限尺寸效应所掩盖；预测了非晶态\\ ce {Li_{0.9} NbO_{0.9} Cl_{4.1}}中的室温场驱动离子电导率为$ 6.8\\ pm 0.7 $ ~ mS/cm ；并用平板校正的静电学对硅/金刚石界面上的界面热传输进行建模。",
              "articleSummary": "Accurate atomistic simulations of materials under electric fields require long-range electrostatics and electrical-response modeling at length scales beyond the reach of conventional first-principles methods. Yet these capabilities remain difficult to reconcile with the scalability of machine-learning interatomic potentials (MLIPs). Strictly local models enable efficient spatial parallelization but neglect long-range interactions, whereas existing electrostatic extensions introduce global dependencies that hinder distributed computation. Here, we overcome this limitation by analytically separating the long-range electrostatic forces and Born effective charges (BECs) into a global electrostatics calculation and strictly local derivatives of learned latent charges. This formulation preserves the spatial decomposability of equivariant MLIPs while enabling distributed evaluation of energies, forces, stresses, and BECs across different boundary conditions. Implemented as DPA4C-LR on the \\texttt{nvalchemi} platform, the framework scales to 5.2 million atoms on four GPUs at approximately twice the computational cost of its short-range backbone. Trained on energies and forces, DPA4C-LR accurately infers BECs and reproduces the field-dependent infrared spectra of water. We further demonstrate its capabilities by recovering the characteristic slim polarization hysteresis of relaxor \\ce{Pb(Mg_{1/3}Nb_{2/3})O3}, which is obscured by finite-size effects in smaller simulations; predicting a room-temperature field-driven ionic conductivity of $6.8 \\pm 0.7$~mS/cm in amorphous \\ce{Li_{0.9}NbO_{0.9}Cl_{4.1}}; and modeling interfacial thermal transport across Si/diamond interfaces with slab-corrected electrostatics. By combining long-range physics, electrical-response inference, and distributed computation, this framework extends predictive atomistic modeling toward device-relevant length scales.",
              "articleSummaryZh": "QUERY LENGTH LIMIT EXCEEDED. MAX ALLOWED QUERY : 500 CHARS 在这里，我们通过将远程静电力和天然有效电荷（ BEC ）分析性地分离成全局静电计算和已知潜在电荷的严格局部导数来克服这一局限性。该配方保留了等变MLIP的空间可分解性，同时允许在不同边界条件下对能量、力、应力和BEC进行分布式评估。 该框架在\\ texttt {nvalchemi}平台上实现为DPA4C-LR ，在四个GPU上扩展到520万个原子，其计算成本大约是其短程骨干网的两倍。经过能量和力的训练， DPA4C-LR准确地推断出BEC ，并再现了水的场相关红外光谱。 我们进一步展示了它的能力，恢复了松弛体\\ ce {Pb (Mg_{1/3} Nb_{2/3}) O3}的特征极化迟滞，这种迟滞在较小的模拟中被有限尺寸效应所掩盖；预测了非晶态\\ ce {Li_{0.9} NbO_{0.9} Cl_{4.1}}中的室温场驱动离子电导率为$ 6.8\\ pm 0.7 $ ~ mS/cm ；并用平板校正的静电学对硅/金刚石界面上的界面热传输进行建模。",
              "discussionFocus": "重点围绕 machine learning interatomic potential 展开。 Strictly local models enable efficient spatial parallelization but neglect long-range interactions, whereas existing electrostatic extensions introduce global dependencies that hinder distributed computation.",
              "discussionFocusZh": "严格的局部模型实现了高效的空间并行化，但忽略了远程相互作用，而现有的静电扩展引入了阻碍分布式计算的全局依赖性。该框架在\\ texttt {nvalchemi}平台上实现为DPA4C-LR ，在四个GPU上扩展到520万个原子，其计算成本大约是其短程骨干网的两倍。 结合关键词看，阅读时应重点关注机器学习原子间势相关的第一性原理设置、对称性分析、能带或响应函数计算，以及这些量与可观测物性的对应关系。"
