              "abstractOriginal": "Using first-principles calculations, we show that altermagnetism emerges in (LaVO$_3$)$_n$/(LaNiO$_3$)$_m$ superlattices, with $(n,m) = (1,1), (2,2)$ and $(2,4)$, from the interplay of interfacial charge transfer and octahedral tilts. Charge transfer drives the system towards the V$^{4+}$ and Ni$^{2+}$ configuration, turning the otherwise paramagnetic nickelate layers into a magnetically active sublattice. The resulting $C$-type antiferromagnetic order, combined with $a^-b^+c^-$ or $a^-b^-c^-$ octahedral tilts, links opposite-spin sublattices only through nonsymmorphic operations, yielding a $d$-wave spin splitting without spin-orbit coupling. Within DFT+U, the splitting reaches 118 meV in the insulating (LVO)$_1$/(LNO)$_1$ superlattice, about twice that calculated for bulk LaVO$_3$, and decreases as the nickelate layers become thicker. Our findings indicate that this splitting is hosted by both the V and Ni sublattices, with nearly half of its weight on oxygen $2p$ states through $p$-$d$ covalency. Interfacial charge transfer thus emerges as a \\textit{design} principle for engineering altermagnetism in oxide heterostructures.",
              "abstractZh": "使用第一原理计算，我们表明，由于界面电荷转移和八面体倾斜的相互作用，(LaVO$_3$)$_n$/(LaNiO$_3$)$_m$ 超晶格中出现了交变磁性，其中 $(n,m) = (1,1)、(2,2)$ 和 $(2,4)$。电荷转移驱动系统朝 V$^{4+}$ 和 Ni$^{2+}$ 配置方向发展，将顺磁性镍酸盐层转变为磁活性亚晶格。 由此产生的 $C$ 型反铁磁序，与 $a^-b^+c^-$ 或 $a^-b^-c^-$ 八面体倾斜相结合，仅通过非对称操作链接相反自旋子晶格，产生没有自旋轨道耦合的 $d$ 波自旋分裂。在 DFT+U 中，绝缘 (LVO)$_1$/(LNO)$_1$ 超晶格中的分裂达到 118 meV，大约是块状 LaVO$_3$ 计算值的两倍，并且随着镍酸盐层变厚而减小。 我们的研究结果表明，这种分裂是由 V 和 Ni 亚晶格主持的，其近一半的重量通过 $p$-$d$ 共价键分布在氧 $2p$ 状态上。因此，界面电荷转移成为氧化物异质结构中工程交变磁性的\\textit{设计}原理。",
              "articleSummary": "Using first-principles calculations, we show that altermagnetism emerges in (LaVO$_3$)$_n$/(LaNiO$_3$)$_m$ superlattices, with $(n,m) = (1,1), (2,2)$ and $(2,4)$, from the interplay of interfacial charge transfer and octahedral tilts. Charge transfer drives the system towards the V$^{4+}$ and Ni$^{2+}$ configuration, turning the otherwise paramagnetic nickelate layers into a magnetically active sublattice. The resulting $C$-type antiferromagnetic order, combined with $a^-b^+c^-$ or $a^-b^-c^-$ octahedral tilts, links opposite-spin sublattices only through nonsymmorphic operations, yielding a $d$-wave spin splitting without spin-orbit coupling. Within DFT+U, the splitting reaches 118 meV in the insulating (LVO)$_1$/(LNO)$_1$ superlattice, about twice that calculated for bulk LaVO$_3$, and decreases as the nickelate layers become thicker. Our findings indicate that this splitting is hosted by both the V and Ni sublattices, with nearly half of its weight on oxygen $2p$ states through $p$-$d$ covalency. Interfacial charge transfer thus emerges as a \\textit{design} principle for engineering altermagnetism in oxide heterostructures.",
              "articleSummaryZh": "使用第一原理计算，我们表明，由于界面电荷转移和八面体倾斜的相互作用，(LaVO$_3$)$_n$/(LaNiO$_3$)$_m$ 超晶格中出现了交变磁性，其中 $(n,m) = (1,1)、(2,2)$ 和 $(2,4)$。电荷转移驱动系统朝 V$^{4+}$ 和 Ni$^{2+}$ 配置方向发展，将顺磁性镍酸盐层转变为磁活性亚晶格。 由此产生的 $C$ 型反铁磁序，与 $a^-b^+c^-$ 或 $a^-b^-c^-$ 八面体倾斜相结合，仅通过非对称操作链接相反自旋子晶格，产生没有自旋轨道耦合的 $d$ 波自旋分裂。在 DFT+U 中，绝缘 (LVO)$_1$/(LNO)$_1$ 超晶格中的分裂达到 118 meV，大约是块状 LaVO$_3$ 计算值的两倍，并且随着镍酸盐层变厚而减小。 我们的研究结果表明，这种分裂是由 V 和 Ni 亚晶格主持的，其近一半的重量通过 $p$-$d$ 共价键分布在氧 $2p$ 状态上。因此，界面电荷转移成为氧化物异质结构中工程交变磁性的\\textit{设计}原理。",
              "discussionFocus": "重点围绕 altermagnetism、altermagnet 展开。 Interfacial charge transfer thus emerges as a \\textit{design} principle for engineering altermagnetism in oxide heterostructures.",
              "discussionFocusZh": "因此，界面电荷转移成为氧化物异质结构中工程交变磁性的\\textit{设计}原理。电荷转移驱动系统朝 V$^{4+}$ 和 Ni$^{2+}$ 配置方向发展，将顺磁性镍酸盐层转变为磁活性亚晶格。 结合关键词看，阅读时应重点关注交变磁性相关的交变磁性的对称性来源、动量空间自旋劈裂，以及这些特征如何影响输运、光学或磁动力学响应。"
