          "abstractOriginal": "We compare two time-reversal-symmetric triangular-lattice Hubbard models at half filling: the zero-flux model and a staggered $π$-flux model with zero and $π$ flux through oppositely oriented triangles. Although both reduce to the same Heisenberg model at leading order in the strong-coupling limit, their distinct charge fluctuation profiles yield different quantum paramagnetic regimes. Combining a strong-coupling expansion with infinite density matrix renormalization group (iDMRG) calculations, we find that the positive ring-exchange of the zero-flux model promotes spontaneous chirality, consistent with its notion of a chiral spin liquid at intermediate coupling. In the staggered-$π$-flux model, whose noninteracting limit is a Dirac semimetal, the ring exchange changes sign and disfavors chiral order and we find no resolvable scalar chirality. This renders flux-tuned ring-exchange an efficient discriminator between chiral and non-chiral quantum paramagnets at finite coupling.",
          "abstractZh": "我们比较半填充时的两个时间反转对称三角晶格哈伯德模型：零通量模型和交错 $π$ 通量模型，其中零通量和 $π$ 通量穿过相反方向的三角形。尽管两者在强耦合极限的前导阶上都简化为相同的海森堡模型，但它们不同的电荷涨落曲线产生了不同的量子顺磁状态。 将强耦合展开式与无限密度矩阵重正化群（iDMRG）计算相结合，我们发现零通量模型的正环交换促进了自发手性，与其中间耦合时手性自旋液体的概念一致。在交错-$π$-通量模型中，其非相互作用极限是狄拉克半金属，环交换改变了符号并且不利于手性顺序，并且我们发现没有可解析的标量手性。 这使得通量调谐环交换成为有限耦合下手性和非手性量子顺磁体之间的有效鉴别器。",
          "articleSummary": "We compare two time-reversal-symmetric triangular-lattice Hubbard models at half filling: the zero-flux model and a staggered $π$-flux model with zero and $π$ flux through oppositely oriented triangles. Although both reduce to the same Heisenberg model at leading order in the strong-coupling limit, their distinct charge fluctuation profiles yield different quantum paramagnetic regimes. Combining a strong-coupling expansion with infinite density matrix renormalization group (iDMRG) calculations, we find that the positive ring-exchange of the zero-flux model promotes spontaneous chirality, consistent with its notion of a chiral spin liquid at intermediate coupling. In the staggered-$π$-flux model, whose noninteracting limit is a Dirac semimetal, the ring exchange changes sign and disfavors chiral order and we find no resolvable scalar chirality. This renders flux-tuned ring-exchange an efficient discriminator between chiral and non-chiral quantum paramagnets at finite coupling.",
          "articleSummaryZh": "我们比较半填充时的两个时间反转对称三角晶格哈伯德模型：零通量模型和交错 $π$ 通量模型，其中零通量和 $π$ 通量穿过相反方向的三角形。尽管两者在强耦合极限的前导阶上都简化为相同的海森堡模型，但它们不同的电荷涨落曲线产生了不同的量子顺磁状态。 将强耦合展开式与无限密度矩阵重正化群（iDMRG）计算相结合，我们发现零通量模型的正环交换促进了自发手性，与其中间耦合时手性自旋液体的概念一致。在交错-$π$-通量模型中，其非相互作用极限是狄拉克半金属，环交换改变了符号并且不利于手性顺序，并且我们发现没有可解析的标量手性。 这使得通量调谐环交换成为有限耦合下手性和非手性量子顺磁体之间的有效鉴别器。",
          "discussionFocus": "重点围绕 Hubbard model、density matrix renormalization group 展开。 We compare two time-reversal-symmetric triangular-lattice Hubbard models at half filling: the zero-flux model and a staggered $π$-flux model with zero and $π$ flux through oppositely oriented triangles.",
          "discussionFocusZh": "我们比较半填充时的两个时间反转对称三角晶格哈伯德模型：零通量模型和交错 $π$ 通量模型，其中零通量和 $π$ 通量穿过相反方向的三角形。尽管两者在强耦合极限的前导阶上都简化为相同的海森堡模型，但它们不同的电荷涨落曲线产生了不同的量子顺磁状态。 结合关键词看，阅读时应重点关注Hubbard 模型、密度矩阵重整化群相关的有效模型参数、电子关联强度、相图边界以及可与实验对照的谱学或输运信号。"
