          "abstractOriginal": "Magnons offer a charge-neutral channel for spin and heat transport, yet reversible and nonvolatile control of their thermal Hall response poses a fundamental challenge in systems with zero net magnetization. Here, we establish ferroelastic switching as an effective route to manipulate magnonic transverse responses in fully compensated ferrimagnets. A minimal Heisenberg-Dzyaloshinskii-Moriya model reveals that ferroelastic switching can re-orientate the lattice anisotropy, which reconstructs the chirality-resolved magnon bands and Berry curvature distribution. Consequently, the two orthogonal fully compensated ferrimagnetic variants related by [C2||C4z] exhibit magnon thermal Hall responses with opposite signs, whereas the response vanishes in the intermediate altermagnetic phase. First-principles calculations further identify monolayer V2SSe as a promising material candidate for realizing the proposed ferroelastic control of transverse magnon transport. Remarkably, ferroelastic switching drives a dual magnonic-electronic band reconstruction, enabling nonvolatile reversal of the magnon thermal Hall effect while producing anisotropic orbital Hall responses and distinct magneto-optical spectra as complementary transport and optical fingerprints. Our findings establish ferroelasticity as an effective route to nonvolatile magnon control and multichannel state identification in zero net magnetization systems.",
          "abstractZh": "磁振子为自旋和热传输提供了电荷中性通道，但对其热霍尔响应的可逆和非易失性控制对净磁化强度为零的系统提出了根本性挑战。在这里，我们将铁弹切换作为操纵完全补偿亚铁磁体中的磁角横向响应的有效途径。最小的 Heisenberg-Dzyaloshinskii-Moriya 模型表明，铁弹性切换可以重新定向晶格各向异性，从而重建手性分辨的磁振子带和贝里曲率分布。 因此，由 [C2||C4z] 相关的两个正交完全补偿的亚铁磁变体表现出具有相反符号的磁振子热霍尔响应，而该响应在中间交磁相中消失。第一原理计算进一步确定单层 V2SSe 作为实现所提出的横向磁振子输运铁弹性控制的有前途的候选材料。 值得注意的是，铁弹性开关驱动双磁电子能带重建，实现磁振子热霍尔效应的非易失性逆转，同时产生各向异性轨道霍尔响应和独特的磁光光谱作为互补的传输和光学指纹。我们的研究结果表明，铁弹性是零净磁化系统中非易失性磁振子控制和多通道状态识别的有效途径。",
          "articleSummary": "Magnons offer a charge-neutral channel for spin and heat transport, yet reversible and nonvolatile control of their thermal Hall response poses a fundamental challenge in systems with zero net magnetization. Here, we establish ferroelastic switching as an effective route to manipulate magnonic transverse responses in fully compensated ferrimagnets. A minimal Heisenberg-Dzyaloshinskii-Moriya model reveals that ferroelastic switching can re-orientate the lattice anisotropy, which reconstructs the chirality-resolved magnon bands and Berry curvature distribution. Consequently, the two orthogonal fully compensated ferrimagnetic variants related by [C2||C4z] exhibit magnon thermal Hall responses with opposite signs, whereas the response vanishes in the intermediate altermagnetic phase. First-principles calculations further identify monolayer V2SSe as a promising material candidate for realizing the proposed ferroelastic control of transverse magnon transport. Remarkably, ferroelastic switching drives a dual magnonic-electronic band reconstruction, enabling nonvolatile reversal of the magnon thermal Hall effect while producing anisotropic orbital Hall responses and distinct magneto-optical spectra as complementary transport and optical fingerprints. Our findings establish ferroelasticity as an effective route to nonvolatile magnon control and multichannel state identification in zero net magnetization systems.",
          "articleSummaryZh": "磁振子为自旋和热传输提供了电荷中性通道，但对其热霍尔响应的可逆和非易失性控制对净磁化强度为零的系统提出了根本性挑战。在这里，我们将铁弹切换作为操纵完全补偿亚铁磁体中的磁角横向响应的有效途径。最小的 Heisenberg-Dzyaloshinskii-Moriya 模型表明，铁弹性切换可以重新定向晶格各向异性，从而重建手性分辨的磁振子带和贝里曲率分布。 因此，由 [C2||C4z] 相关的两个正交完全补偿的亚铁磁变体表现出具有相反符号的磁振子热霍尔响应，而该响应在中间交磁相中消失。第一原理计算进一步确定单层 V2SSe 作为实现所提出的横向磁振子输运铁弹性控制的有前途的候选材料。 值得注意的是，铁弹性开关驱动双磁电子能带重建，实现磁振子热霍尔效应的非易失性逆转，同时产生各向异性轨道霍尔响应和独特的磁光光谱作为互补的传输和光学指纹。我们的研究结果表明，铁弹性是零净磁化系统中非易失性磁振子控制和多通道状态识别的有效途径。",
          "discussionFocus": "重点围绕 altermagnetic、altermagnet 展开。 A minimal Heisenberg-Dzyaloshinskii-Moriya model reveals that ferroelastic switching can re-orientate the lattice anisotropy, which reconstructs the chirality-resolved magnon bands and Berry curvature distribution.",
          "discussionFocusZh": "最小的 Heisenberg-Dzyaloshinskii-Moriya 模型表明，铁弹性切换可以重新定向晶格各向异性，从而重建手性分辨的磁振子带和贝里曲率分布。在这里，我们将铁弹切换作为操纵完全补偿亚铁磁体中的磁角横向响应的有效途径。 结合关键词看，阅读时应重点关注交变磁性相关的交变磁性的对称性来源、动量空间自旋劈裂，以及这些特征如何影响输运、光学或磁动力学响应。"
