              "abstractOriginal": "Symmetry is usually viewed as a constraint on physical responses, but it can also be used to design the fields that control them. Here, we adopt the representation-matching principle used to identify conjugate fields of order parameters and apply it to response tensors. A linear coupling, the key ingredient for sign-switching control, is symmetry-allowed when a component (or a combination of components) of the control field and the selected response component share the same irreducible representation of the magnetic point group (MPG) of the system. Applied to the magneto-optical Kerr effect, this principle yields a piezo-Kerr effect, in which specific strain combinations activate a Kerr response forbidden in the unstrained state. Enumerating all 122 MPGs, we identify 16 groups in which the unstrained Kerr response is forbidden while a linear strain-induced contribution is allowed. These groups are realized by altermagnets and noncollinear antiferromagnets with symmetry-enforced vanishing net magnetization. The active strain channels and the associated first-order sign reversals follow directly from symmetry. First-principles calculations for bulk MnTe$_{2}$ and CoF$_{2}$, and Cr$_{2}$Se$_{2}$O and Cr$_{2}$Te$_{2}$O monolayers confirm these predictions. In these materials, the Kerr rotation vanishes without strain, whereas 0.5-3% strain produces rotations ranging from tens to hundreds of millidegrees, and reversing the matched strain channel reverses the Kerr sign. These results establish a general route to large and switchable Kerr responses emerging from symmetry-forbidden states in compensated magnets.",
              "abstractZh": "对称性通常被视为对物理响应的约束，但它也可以用于设计控制它们的场。在这里，我们采用表示匹配原理来识别阶次参数的共轭场并将其应用于响应张量。当控制场的一个分量（或分量的组合）和选定的响应分量共享系统磁点组（MPG）的相同不可约表示时，线性耦合是符号切换控制的关键要素，是允许对称的。 应用于磁光克尔效应时，该原理会产生压电克尔效应，其中特定的应变组合激活在无应变状态下禁止的克尔响应。枚举所有 122 个 MPG，我们确定了 16 个组，其中禁止无应变克尔响应，而允许线性应变引起的贡献。这些组是通过具有对称强制消失净磁化的交变磁体和非共线反铁磁体来实现的。主动应变通道和相关的一阶符号反转直接遵循对称性。 大块 MnTe$_{2}$ 和 CoF$_{2}$、Cr$_{2}$Se$_{2}$O 和 Cr$_{2}$Te$_{2}$O 单层的第一性原理计算证实了这些预测。在这些材料中，克尔旋转在没有应变的情况下消失，而 0.5-3% 的应变会产生数十到数百毫度的旋转，并且反转匹配的应变通道会反转克尔符号。这些结果建立了从补偿磁体的对称禁止态中产生大的、可切换的克尔响应的一般途径。",
              "articleSummary": "Symmetry is usually viewed as a constraint on physical responses, but it can also be used to design the fields that control them. Here, we adopt the representation-matching principle used to identify conjugate fields of order parameters and apply it to response tensors. A linear coupling, the key ingredient for sign-switching control, is symmetry-allowed when a component (or a combination of components) of the control field and the selected response component share the same irreducible representation of the magnetic point group (MPG) of the system. Applied to the magneto-optical Kerr effect, this principle yields a piezo-Kerr effect, in which specific strain combinations activate a Kerr response forbidden in the unstrained state. Enumerating all 122 MPGs, we identify 16 groups in which the unstrained Kerr response is forbidden while a linear strain-induced contribution is allowed. These groups are realized by altermagnets and noncollinear antiferromagnets with symmetry-enforced vanishing net magnetization. The active strain channels and the associated first-order sign reversals follow directly from symmetry. First-principles calculations for bulk MnTe$_{2}$ and CoF$_{2}$, and Cr$_{2}$Se$_{2}$O and Cr$_{2}$Te$_{2}$O monolayers confirm these predictions. In these materials, the Kerr rotation vanishes without strain, whereas 0.5-3% strain produces rotations ranging from tens to hundreds of millidegrees, and reversing the matched strain channel reverses the Kerr sign. These results establish a general route to large and switchable Kerr responses emerging from symmetry-forbidden states in compensated magnets.",
              "articleSummaryZh": "对称性通常被视为对物理响应的约束，但它也可以用于设计控制它们的场。在这里，我们采用表示匹配原理来识别阶次参数的共轭场并将其应用于响应张量。当控制场的一个分量（或分量的组合）和选定的响应分量共享系统磁点组（MPG）的相同不可约表示时，线性耦合是符号切换控制的关键要素，是允许对称的。 应用于磁光克尔效应时，该原理会产生压电克尔效应，其中特定的应变组合激活在无应变状态下禁止的克尔响应。枚举所有 122 个 MPG，我们确定了 16 个组，其中禁止无应变克尔响应，而允许线性应变引起的贡献。这些组是通过具有对称强制消失净磁化的交变磁体和非共线反铁磁体来实现的。主动应变通道和相关的一阶符号反转直接遵循对称性。 大块 MnTe$_{2}$ 和 CoF$_{2}$、Cr$_{2}$Se$_{2}$O 和 Cr$_{2}$Te$_{2}$O 单层的第一性原理计算证实了这些预测。在这些材料中，克尔旋转在没有应变的情况下消失，而 0.5-3% 的应变会产生数十到数百毫度的旋转，并且反转匹配的应变通道会反转克尔符号。这些结果建立了从补偿磁体的对称禁止态中产生大的、可切换的克尔响应的一般途径。",
              "discussionFocus": "重点围绕 altermagnet 展开。 Symmetry is usually viewed as a constraint on physical responses, but it can also be used to design the fields that control them.",
              "discussionFocusZh": "对称性通常被视为对物理响应的约束，但它也可以用于设计控制它们的场。在这里，我们采用表示匹配原理来识别阶次参数的共轭场并将其应用于响应张量。 结合关键词看，阅读时应重点关注交变磁性相关的交变磁性的对称性来源、动量空间自旋劈裂，以及这些特征如何影响输运、光学或磁动力学响应。"
