              "abstractOriginal": "Wen's projective symmetry group (PSG), introduced a quarter of a century ago, reduced the classification of symmetric quantum spin liquids to an algebraic problem and has guided the study of spin-$1/2$ models and materials ever since. Many current candidate materials and quantum simulators, however, have spin-$1$ or larger moments, and no comparable classification exists for them. We formulate the PSG for fermionic partons of arbitrary spin $S$. Integer and half-odd-integer spins already differ in their gauge structure. Half-odd-integer spins give the familiar $\\mathrm{SU}(2)$, $\\mathrm{U}(1)$, and $\\mathbb{Z}_2$ invariant gauge groups, while integer spins give a different hierarchy that includes $\\mathrm{U}(1)\\rtimes\\mathbb{Z}_2$ and $\\mathbb{Z}_2\\times\\mathbb{Z}_2$; the latter has no spin-$1/2$ counterpart. Three lattice-independent results follow for integer spin. Singlet pairing of the partons is odd under site exchange. A lattice symmetry can exchange the particle and hole representations of the local constraint, which forces symmetry-related sites into opposite constraint sectors. And a time-reversal-symmetric $\\mathrm{U}(1)$ state with the same constraint on every site can be gapped only if the number of sites per unit cell is a multiple of $2S+1$. We apply the formalism to the spin-$1$ diamond lattice, realized in frustrated A-site spinels, and find ten fully symmetric Ansätze up to second neighbors. In the $J_1$-$J_2$ Heisenberg model at the mean-field level, the ground state depends on how the constraint is imposed. With the particle and hole representations, the lowest states are fully gapped $\\mathrm{U}(1)$ states whose two sublattices sit in opposite constraint sectors, and one of them is gauge equivalent to a paired Ansatz. The classification provides a starting point for integer-spin quantum spin liquids on other lattices and in other materials.",
              "abstractZh": "Wen 的射影对称群 (PSG) 在 25 年前提出，将对称量子自旋液体的分类简化为代数问题，并从此指导了自旋 $1/2$ 模型和材料的研究。然而，当前许多候选材料和量子模拟器都具有 1 美元或更大的自旋矩，并且不存在可比的分类。我们制定了任意自旋$S$的费米子部分子的PSG。整数和半奇整数自旋的规范结构已经不同。 半奇整数自旋给出了熟悉的 $\\mathrm{SU}(2)$、$\\mathrm{U}(1)$ 和 $\\mathbb{Z}_2$ 不变规范组，而整数自旋给出了不同的层次结构，包括 $\\mathrm{U}(1)\\rtimes\\mathbb{Z}_2$ 和 $\\mathbb{Z}_2\\times\\mathbb{Z}_2$；后者没有 spin-$1/2$ 对应物。对于整数自旋，三个与晶格无关的结果如下。在位点交换下，部分子的单线态配对是奇怪的。晶格对称性可以交换局部约束的粒子和孔表示，这迫使对称相关的位点进入相反的约束扇区。 仅当每个晶胞的位点数量是 $2S+1$ 的倍数时，每个位点具有相同约束的时间反转对称 $\\mathrm{U}(1)$ 状态才能有间隙。我们将形式主义应用于自旋 $1$ 金刚石晶格，在受挫的 A 位尖晶石中实现，并找到十个完全对称的 Ansätze 直到第二个邻居。在平均场水平的 $J_1$-$J_2$ 海森堡模型中，基态取决于如何施加约束。 对于粒子和空穴表示，最低状态是完全有间隙的 $\\mathrm{U}(1)$ 状态，其两个子晶格位于相反的约束扇区，其中一个子晶格的规范相当于一对 Ansatz。该分类为其他晶格和其他材料中的整数自旋量子自旋液体提供了一个起点。",
              "articleSummary": "Wen's projective symmetry group (PSG), introduced a quarter of a century ago, reduced the classification of symmetric quantum spin liquids to an algebraic problem and has guided the study of spin-$1/2$ models and materials ever since. Many current candidate materials and quantum simulators, however, have spin-$1$ or larger moments, and no comparable classification exists for them. We formulate the PSG for fermionic partons of arbitrary spin $S$. Integer and half-odd-integer spins already differ in their gauge structure. Half-odd-integer spins give the familiar $\\mathrm{SU}(2)$, $\\mathrm{U}(1)$, and $\\mathbb{Z}_2$ invariant gauge groups, while integer spins give a different hierarchy that includes $\\mathrm{U}(1)\\rtimes\\mathbb{Z}_2$ and $\\mathbb{Z}_2\\times\\mathbb{Z}_2$; the latter has no spin-$1/2$ counterpart. Three lattice-independent results follow for integer spin. Singlet pairing of the partons is odd under site exchange. A lattice symmetry can exchange the particle and hole representations of the local constraint, which forces symmetry-related sites into opposite constraint sectors. And a time-reversal-symmetric $\\mathrm{U}(1)$ state with the same constraint on every site can be gapped only if the number of sites per unit cell is a multiple of $2S+1$. We apply the formalism to the spin-$1$ diamond lattice, realized in frustrated A-site spinels, and find ten fully symmetric Ansätze up to second neighbors. In the $J_1$-$J_2$ Heisenberg model at the mean-field level, the ground state depends on how the constraint is imposed. With the particle and hole representations, the lowest states are fully gapped $\\mathrm{U}(1)$ states whose two sublattices sit in opposite constraint sectors, and one of them is gauge equivalent to a paired Ansatz. The classification provides a starting point for integer-spin quantum spin liquids on other lattices and in other materials.",
              "articleSummaryZh": "Wen 的射影对称群 (PSG) 在 25 年前提出，将对称量子自旋液体的分类简化为代数问题，并从此指导了自旋 $1/2$ 模型和材料的研究。然而，当前许多候选材料和量子模拟器都具有 1 美元或更大的自旋矩，并且不存在可比的分类。我们制定了任意自旋$S$的费米子部分子的PSG。整数和半奇整数自旋的规范结构已经不同。 半奇整数自旋给出了熟悉的 $\\mathrm{SU}(2)$、$\\mathrm{U}(1)$ 和 $\\mathbb{Z}_2$ 不变规范组，而整数自旋给出了不同的层次结构，包括 $\\mathrm{U}(1)\\rtimes\\mathbb{Z}_2$ 和 $\\mathbb{Z}_2\\times\\mathbb{Z}_2$；后者没有 spin-$1/2$ 对应物。对于整数自旋，三个与晶格无关的结果如下。在位点交换下，部分子的单线态配对是奇怪的。晶格对称性可以交换局部约束的粒子和孔表示，这迫使对称相关的位点进入相反的约束扇区。 仅当每个晶胞的位点数量是 $2S+1$ 的倍数时，每个位点具有相同约束的时间反转对称 $\\mathrm{U}(1)$ 状态才能有间隙。我们将形式主义应用于自旋 $1$ 金刚石晶格，在受挫的 A 位尖晶石中实现，并找到十个完全对称的 Ansätze 直到第二个邻居。在平均场水平的 $J_1$-$J_2$ 海森堡模型中，基态取决于如何施加约束。 对于粒子和空穴表示，最低状态是完全有间隙的 $\\mathrm{U}(1)$ 状态，其两个子晶格位于相反的约束扇区，其中一个子晶格的规范相当于一对 Ansatz。该分类为其他晶格和其他材料中的整数自旋量子自旋液体提供了一个起点。",
              "discussionFocus": "重点围绕 quantum spin liquid 展开。 Wen's projective symmetry group (PSG), introduced a quarter of a century ago, reduced the classification of symmetric quantum spin liquids to an algebraic problem and has guided the study of spin-$1/2$ models and materials ever since.",
              "discussionFocusZh": "Wen 的射影对称群 (PSG) 在 25 年前提出，将对称量子自旋液体的分类简化为代数问题，并从此指导了自旋 $1/2$ 模型和材料的研究。在平均场水平的 $J_1$-$J_2$ 海森堡模型中，基态取决于如何施加约束。 结合关键词看，阅读时应重点关注量子自旋液体相关的新方法的假设、训练或计算流程、适用体系，以及与已有方法相比的优势和局限。"
