              "abstractOriginal": "Aluminum nitride-based ferroelectrics combine high remanent polarization, thermal stability, weak size effects, a wide bandgap and back-end process compatibility, making them promising for high density non-volatile memory. However, their high coercive field ($E_\\mathrm{c}$) and unclear polarization switching mechanism limit further applications. Theoretical predictions indicate preferential reversed domain growth along the polar axis, whereas experiments show nearly isotropic growth or preferential growth perpendicular to this axis. Here, we combine density functional theory, Deep Potential molecular dynamics and experimental characterization to determine how nitrogen vacancies ($V_\\mathrm{N}$) regulate domain growth and $E_\\mathrm{c}$. In ideal crystal, strong lattice coupling along the polar axis drives preferential domain growth in this direction. $V_\\mathrm{N}$ locally weakens this coupling and promotes polarization nucleation. The spatial distribution of $V_\\mathrm{N}$ and the temporal sequence of vacancy induced switching jointly determine the direction and morphology of reversed domain growth. We further show that scandium doping promotes $V_\\mathrm{N}$ formation, thereby enhancing defect mediated nucleation and reducing $E_\\mathrm{c}$. These findings establish a multiscale mechanism governing thin-film domain-growth kinetics and macroscopic $E_\\mathrm{c}$, reconciling experimental observations with ideal crystal simulations and providing defect engineering principles for low-voltage, reliable and scalable ferroelectric devices.",
              "abstractZh": "氮化铝基铁电体结合了高剩余极化、热稳定性、弱尺寸效应、宽带隙和后端工艺兼容性，使其有望用于高密度非易失性存储器。然而，它们的高矫顽场（$E_\\mathrm{c}$）和不明确的偏振切换机制限制了进一步的应用。理论预测表明沿极轴优先反向域生长，而实验显示近各向同性生长或垂直于该轴的优先生长。 在这里，我们结合密度泛函理论、深势分子动力学和实验表征来确定氮空位 ($V_\\mathrm{N}$) 如何调节域生长和 $E_\\mathrm{c}$。在理想晶体中，沿极轴的强晶格耦合驱动沿该方向的择优生长。 $V_\\mathrm{N}$ 局部减弱这种耦合并促进极化成核。 $V_\\mathrm{N}$ 的空间分布和空位引起的切换的时间序列共同决定了反向域生长的方向和形态。 我们进一步表明，钪掺杂促进 $V_\\mathrm{N}$ 的形成，从而增强缺陷介导的成核并减少 $E_\\mathrm{c}$。这些发现建立了控制薄膜畴生长动力学和宏观$E_\\mathrm{c}$的多尺度机制，将实验观察与理想晶体模拟相协调，并为低电压、可靠和可扩展的铁电器件提供缺陷工程原理。",
              "articleSummary": "Aluminum nitride-based ferroelectrics combine high remanent polarization, thermal stability, weak size effects, a wide bandgap and back-end process compatibility, making them promising for high density non-volatile memory. However, their high coercive field ($E_\\mathrm{c}$) and unclear polarization switching mechanism limit further applications. Theoretical predictions indicate preferential reversed domain growth along the polar axis, whereas experiments show nearly isotropic growth or preferential growth perpendicular to this axis. Here, we combine density functional theory, Deep Potential molecular dynamics and experimental characterization to determine how nitrogen vacancies ($V_\\mathrm{N}$) regulate domain growth and $E_\\mathrm{c}$. In ideal crystal, strong lattice coupling along the polar axis drives preferential domain growth in this direction. $V_\\mathrm{N}$ locally weakens this coupling and promotes polarization nucleation. The spatial distribution of $V_\\mathrm{N}$ and the temporal sequence of vacancy induced switching jointly determine the direction and morphology of reversed domain growth. We further show that scandium doping promotes $V_\\mathrm{N}$ formation, thereby enhancing defect mediated nucleation and reducing $E_\\mathrm{c}$. These findings establish a multiscale mechanism governing thin-film domain-growth kinetics and macroscopic $E_\\mathrm{c}$, reconciling experimental observations with ideal crystal simulations and providing defect engineering principles for low-voltage, reliable and scalable ferroelectric devices.",
              "articleSummaryZh": "氮化铝基铁电体结合了高剩余极化、热稳定性、弱尺寸效应、宽带隙和后端工艺兼容性，使其有望用于高密度非易失性存储器。然而，它们的高矫顽场（$E_\\mathrm{c}$）和不明确的偏振切换机制限制了进一步的应用。理论预测表明沿极轴优先反向域生长，而实验显示近各向同性生长或垂直于该轴的优先生长。 在这里，我们结合密度泛函理论、深势分子动力学和实验表征来确定氮空位 ($V_\\mathrm{N}$) 如何调节域生长和 $E_\\mathrm{c}$。在理想晶体中，沿极轴的强晶格耦合驱动沿该方向的择优生长。 $V_\\mathrm{N}$ 局部减弱这种耦合并促进极化成核。 $V_\\mathrm{N}$ 的空间分布和空位引起的切换的时间序列共同决定了反向域生长的方向和形态。 我们进一步表明，钪掺杂促进 $V_\\mathrm{N}$ 的形成，从而增强缺陷介导的成核并减少 $E_\\mathrm{c}$。这些发现建立了控制薄膜畴生长动力学和宏观$E_\\mathrm{c}$的多尺度机制，将实验观察与理想晶体模拟相协调，并为低电压、可靠和可扩展的铁电器件提供缺陷工程原理。",
              "discussionFocus": "重点围绕 deep potential molecular dynamics 展开。 However, their high coercive field ($E_\\mathrm{c}$) and unclear polarization switching mechanism limit further applications.",
              "discussionFocusZh": "氮化铝基铁电体结合了高剩余极化、热稳定性、弱尺寸效应、宽带隙和后端工艺兼容性，使其有望用于高密度非易失性存储器。然而，它们的高矫顽场（$E_\\mathrm{c}$）和不明确的偏振切换机制限制了进一步的应用。 结合关键词看，阅读时应重点关注深度势分子动力学相关的极化翻转、磁电耦合、自旋-晶格耦合以及多铁序参量之间的相互制约。"
