              "abstractOriginal": "We study coherent two-terminal transport through a finite-width $d$-wave altermagnetic quantum ring with nonmagnetic leads. A confined Aharonov--Bohm flux remains exactly $h/e$ periodic and, in the symmetric one-mode geometry, produces an exact half-flux transmission zero. A perpendicular field shifts the interference pattern according to an effective area $A_{\\rm eff}=1.0342\\,πr_0^2$ and the altermagnetic splitting resolves the common zero into nearby spin-dependent nodes. Rotating the crystal reverses the transmitted spin, whereas the mirror orientation $θ_A=π/4$ is exactly spin degenerate. For a $50$~nm reference ring, sub-tesla fields yield windows with $|P_T|>0.99$, the most accessible of which requires a uniform field alone and no confined flux. Finite-bias, thermal, disorder, Zeeman, and spin-conserving voltage-probe calculations show that the polarization is appreciably more stable than individual coherent-resonance amplitudes. These results identify interference-node positions, flux periodicity, and crystal-controlled spin polarization as experimentally useful signatures of an altermagnetic mesoscopic interferometer.",
              "abstractZh": "我们研究通过具有非磁性引线的有限宽度 $d$ 波交变磁量子环的相干两端传输。受限的阿哈罗诺夫-玻姆通量保持精确的 $h/e$ 周期性，并且在对称单模几何结构中，产生精确的半通量传输零。垂直场根据有效面积 $A_{\\rm eff}=1.0342\\,πr_0^2$ 移动干涉图案，并且交变磁分裂将公共零解析为附近的自旋相关节点。旋转晶体会反转传输的自旋，而镜子方向 $θ_A=π/4$ 恰好是自旋简并。 对于 $50$~nm 参考环，亚特斯拉场产生 $|P_T|>0.99$ 的窗口，其中最容易获得的窗口需要单独的均匀场并且没有受限通量。有限偏置、热、无序、塞曼和自旋守恒电压探针计算表明，极化明显比单个相干共振振幅更稳定。这些结果将干涉节点位置、通量周期性和晶体控制的自旋极化确定为交变介观干涉仪在实验上有用的特征。",
              "articleSummary": "We study coherent two-terminal transport through a finite-width $d$-wave altermagnetic quantum ring with nonmagnetic leads. A confined Aharonov--Bohm flux remains exactly $h/e$ periodic and, in the symmetric one-mode geometry, produces an exact half-flux transmission zero. A perpendicular field shifts the interference pattern according to an effective area $A_{\\rm eff}=1.0342\\,πr_0^2$ and the altermagnetic splitting resolves the common zero into nearby spin-dependent nodes. Rotating the crystal reverses the transmitted spin, whereas the mirror orientation $θ_A=π/4$ is exactly spin degenerate. For a $50$~nm reference ring, sub-tesla fields yield windows with $|P_T|>0.99$, the most accessible of which requires a uniform field alone and no confined flux. Finite-bias, thermal, disorder, Zeeman, and spin-conserving voltage-probe calculations show that the polarization is appreciably more stable than individual coherent-resonance amplitudes. These results identify interference-node positions, flux periodicity, and crystal-controlled spin polarization as experimentally useful signatures of an altermagnetic mesoscopic interferometer.",
              "articleSummaryZh": "我们研究通过具有非磁性引线的有限宽度 $d$ 波交变磁量子环的相干两端传输。受限的阿哈罗诺夫-玻姆通量保持精确的 $h/e$ 周期性，并且在对称单模几何结构中，产生精确的半通量传输零。垂直场根据有效面积 $A_{\\rm eff}=1.0342\\,πr_0^2$ 移动干涉图案，并且交变磁分裂将公共零解析为附近的自旋相关节点。旋转晶体会反转传输的自旋，而镜子方向 $θ_A=π/4$ 恰好是自旋简并。 对于 $50$~nm 参考环，亚特斯拉场产生 $|P_T|>0.99$ 的窗口，其中最容易获得的窗口需要单独的均匀场并且没有受限通量。有限偏置、热、无序、塞曼和自旋守恒电压探针计算表明，极化明显比单个相干共振振幅更稳定。这些结果将干涉节点位置、通量周期性和晶体控制的自旋极化确定为交变介观干涉仪在实验上有用的特征。",
              "discussionFocus": "重点围绕 altermagnetic、altermagnet 展开。 We study coherent two-terminal transport through a finite-width $d$-wave altermagnetic quantum ring with nonmagnetic leads.",
              "discussionFocusZh": "我们研究通过具有非磁性引线的有限宽度 $d$ 波交变磁量子环的相干两端传输。受限的阿哈罗诺夫-玻姆通量保持精确的 $h/e$ 周期性，并且在对称单模几何结构中，产生精确的半通量传输零。 结合关键词看，阅读时应重点关注交变磁性相关的交变磁性的对称性来源、动量空间自旋劈裂，以及这些特征如何影响输运、光学或磁动力学响应。"
