              "abstractOriginal": "Motivated by the recent progress in correlated Chern insulator physics in moiré systems, we investigate the half-filled triangular-lattice Hofstadter--Hubbard model and its electron fractionalization. Among various competing non-magnetic states, increasing the orbital flux stabilizes and broadens the $\\mathrm{U}(1)_2$ chiral spin liquid phase in the Mott regime. In this exotic regime, the electron is fractionalized into gapped spinons and gapped chargons, whose effective bands are linked to the orbital flux. The convolution of the narrow spinon bands with the gapped chargon excitations produces rich and discernible structures in the electron spectral function and the density of states. These results not only identify the orbital flux as a control parameter for the detailed patterns of electron fractionalization and the nature of the Mott transition, but also provide the key spectral characteristics for the angle-resolved photoemission and scanning tunneling studies of the relevant systems, linking the free-particle band topology to intrinsic topological order in the correlated regime.",
              "abstractZh": "受莫尔系统中相关陈绝缘体物理最新进展的推动，我们研究了半填充三角晶格 Hofstadter-Hubbard 模型及其电子分裂。在各种竞争的非磁性状态中，增加轨道通量可以稳定并拓宽莫特体系中的 $\\mathrm{U}(1)_2$ 手性自旋液相。在这种奇异的状态下，电子被分成有隙自旋子和有隙电荷，其有效能带与轨道通量相关。 窄自旋子带与带隙电荷激发的卷积在电子谱函数和态密度中产生丰富且可辨别的结构。这些结果不仅将轨道通量确定为电子分裂详细模式和莫特跃迁性质的控制参数，而且还为相关系统的角分辨光发射和扫描隧道研究提供了关键的光谱特征，将自由粒子能带拓扑与相关区域中的固有拓扑顺序联系起来。",
              "articleSummary": "Motivated by the recent progress in correlated Chern insulator physics in moiré systems, we investigate the half-filled triangular-lattice Hofstadter--Hubbard model and its electron fractionalization. Among various competing non-magnetic states, increasing the orbital flux stabilizes and broadens the $\\mathrm{U}(1)_2$ chiral spin liquid phase in the Mott regime. In this exotic regime, the electron is fractionalized into gapped spinons and gapped chargons, whose effective bands are linked to the orbital flux. The convolution of the narrow spinon bands with the gapped chargon excitations produces rich and discernible structures in the electron spectral function and the density of states. These results not only identify the orbital flux as a control parameter for the detailed patterns of electron fractionalization and the nature of the Mott transition, but also provide the key spectral characteristics for the angle-resolved photoemission and scanning tunneling studies of the relevant systems, linking the free-particle band topology to intrinsic topological order in the correlated regime.",
              "articleSummaryZh": "受莫尔系统中相关陈绝缘体物理最新进展的推动，我们研究了半填充三角晶格 Hofstadter-Hubbard 模型及其电子分裂。在各种竞争的非磁性状态中，增加轨道通量可以稳定并拓宽莫特体系中的 $\\mathrm{U}(1)_2$ 手性自旋液相。在这种奇异的状态下，电子被分成有隙自旋子和有隙电荷，其有效能带与轨道通量相关。 窄自旋子带与带隙电荷激发的卷积在电子谱函数和态密度中产生丰富且可辨别的结构。这些结果不仅将轨道通量确定为电子分裂详细模式和莫特跃迁性质的控制参数，而且还为相关系统的角分辨光发射和扫描隧道研究提供了关键的光谱特征，将自由粒子能带拓扑与相关区域中的固有拓扑顺序联系起来。",
              "discussionFocus": "重点围绕 Hubbard model 展开。 Motivated by the recent progress in correlated Chern insulator physics in moiré systems, we investigate the half-filled triangular-lattice Hofstadter--Hubbard model and its electron fractionalization.",
              "discussionFocusZh": "受莫尔系统中相关陈绝缘体物理最新进展的推动，我们研究了半填充三角晶格 Hofstadter-Hubbard 模型及其电子分裂。在各种竞争的非磁性状态中，增加轨道通量可以稳定并拓宽莫特体系中的 $\\mathrm{U}(1)_2$ 手性自旋液相。 结合关键词看，阅读时应重点关注Hubbard 模型相关的有效模型参数、电子关联强度、相图边界以及可与实验对照的谱学或输运信号。"
