          "abstractOriginal": "The full frequency dependence of electronic interactions is central to dynamical correlations, but its numerical cost restricts multiorbital calculations. We formulate the multiloop functional renormalization group directly in the quantics tensor train representation, retaining all three independent vertex frequencies over broad ranges without an explicit high-frequency parametrization. Analytical tensor operators perform frequency transformations and internal summations without dense vertex intermediates. Multiloop corrections improve agreement of vertices and responses with independent references and reproduce the low-energy numerical renormalization group self-energy. Lower-temperature calculations resolve a quadratic frequency contribution to the analytically continued scattering rate. A degenerate two-orbital impurity exhibits distinct spin, orbital, and charge responses at fixed Hund coupling. In a compensated altermagnetic environment, an orbital-level splitting induces a local spin response despite zero magnetization of the unperturbed impurity. Increasing Hund coupling suppresses the orbital response while increasing its spin polarization. Renormalized one-particle propagation alone does not reproduce this strong polarization dependence. These results extend compressed multiloop calculations to dynamical correlations in multiorbital environments.",
          "abstractZh": "电子相互作用的完全频率依赖性是动态相关性的核心，但其数值成本限制了多轨道计算。我们直接在量子张量序列表示中制定多循环函数重整化群，在广泛的范围内保留所有三个独立的顶点频率，而无需显式的高频参数化。分析张量运算符执行频率变换和内部求和，无需密集顶点中间值。 多环校正提高了顶点和响应与独立参考的一致性，并再现了低能量数值重正化群自能。较低温度计算解决了二次频率对分析连续散射率的影响。简并二轨道杂质在固定亨德耦合下表现出独特的自旋、轨道和电荷响应。在补偿交变磁环境中，尽管未受干扰的杂质的磁化强度为零，但轨道能级分裂仍会引起局部自旋响应。 增加亨德耦合会抑制轨道响应，同时增加其自旋极化。单独重整化的单粒子传播并不能重现这种强烈的偏振依赖性。这些结果将压缩多环计算扩展到多轨道环境中的动态相关性。",
          "articleSummary": "The full frequency dependence of electronic interactions is central to dynamical correlations, but its numerical cost restricts multiorbital calculations. We formulate the multiloop functional renormalization group directly in the quantics tensor train representation, retaining all three independent vertex frequencies over broad ranges without an explicit high-frequency parametrization. Analytical tensor operators perform frequency transformations and internal summations without dense vertex intermediates. Multiloop corrections improve agreement of vertices and responses with independent references and reproduce the low-energy numerical renormalization group self-energy. Lower-temperature calculations resolve a quadratic frequency contribution to the analytically continued scattering rate. A degenerate two-orbital impurity exhibits distinct spin, orbital, and charge responses at fixed Hund coupling. In a compensated altermagnetic environment, an orbital-level splitting induces a local spin response despite zero magnetization of the unperturbed impurity. Increasing Hund coupling suppresses the orbital response while increasing its spin polarization. Renormalized one-particle propagation alone does not reproduce this strong polarization dependence. These results extend compressed multiloop calculations to dynamical correlations in multiorbital environments.",
          "articleSummaryZh": "电子相互作用的完全频率依赖性是动态相关性的核心，但其数值成本限制了多轨道计算。我们直接在量子张量序列表示中制定多循环函数重整化群，在广泛的范围内保留所有三个独立的顶点频率，而无需显式的高频参数化。分析张量运算符执行频率变换和内部求和，无需密集顶点中间值。 多环校正提高了顶点和响应与独立参考的一致性，并再现了低能量数值重正化群自能。较低温度计算解决了二次频率对分析连续散射率的影响。简并二轨道杂质在固定亨德耦合下表现出独特的自旋、轨道和电荷响应。在补偿交变磁环境中，尽管未受干扰的杂质的磁化强度为零，但轨道能级分裂仍会引起局部自旋响应。 增加亨德耦合会抑制轨道响应，同时增加其自旋极化。单独重整化的单粒子传播并不能重现这种强烈的偏振依赖性。这些结果将压缩多环计算扩展到多轨道环境中的动态相关性。",
          "discussionFocus": "重点围绕 altermagnetic、altermagnet 展开。 We formulate the multiloop functional renormalization group directly in the quantics tensor train representation, retaining all three independent vertex frequencies over broad ranges without an explicit high-frequency parametrization.",
          "discussionFocusZh": "电子相互作用的完全频率依赖性是动态相关性的核心，但其数值成本限制了多轨道计算。我们直接在量子张量序列表示中制定多循环函数重整化群，在广泛的范围内保留所有三个独立的顶点频率，而无需显式的高频参数化。 结合关键词看，阅读时应重点关注交变磁性相关的交变磁性的对称性来源、动量空间自旋劈裂，以及这些特征如何影响输运、光学或磁动力学响应。"
