      "abstractOriginal": "Five metals share a common sublattice in the (Hf,Ta,Ti,Nb,Zr)B$_2$ (HEB$_2$). Most high-entropy materials are produced as polycrystalline materials in the form of sintered ceramics. The question of which metal species are located at grain boundaries is still unknown. Here, we calculated the grain-boundary energy $γ_{GB}$ of four types of boundaries in five binary diborides and HEB$_2$ using density functional theory (DFT). We analyzed the bonding at these boundaries using COHP and sampled cation segregation at six boundaries of HEB$_2$, ordered and general, using Monte Carlo / molecular dynamics with a MACE potential that was fine-tuned for this system. According to our results $γ_{GB}$ splits by group: the group V diborides NbB$_2$ and TaB$_2$ form boundaries with about half the energy of the group IV at three of the four types of GBs, ranging from 0.8 to 2.7 compared to 2.5--4.8~J/m$^2$. COHP shows a significant difference at the Fermi level, namely the Me--B bonds of NbB$_2$ and TaB$_2$ are antibonding at Fermi energy ($E_F$) in the bulk but bonding at the GB, while their integrated strength hardly changes. In HEB$_2$ the segregation follows a similar pattern: Nb and Ta are enriched at five of the six grain boundaries, including general boundaries, up to 23--35~at.\\% at 2000~K, although the size of the atoms would favor Zr and Hf in the expanded sites. A segregated $Σ193$ grain boundary can withstand 26 against 20~GPa for a random boundary in tension at 300~K. The grain boundaries of HEB$_2$ are composed of group V metals, as suggested by the boundary energies of binaries compounds and their bonding at the Fermi level. Grain boundaries of the (Hf,Ta,Ti,Nb,Zr)B$_2$ preferentially include Nb and Ta. This lowers the grain boundary energy and strengthens the boundaries. This consists of the lower boundary energy and changes Fermi level bonding in NbB$_2$ and TaB$_2$.",
      "abstractZh": "五种金属在 (Hf,Ta,Ti,Nb,Zr)B$_2$ (HEB$_2$) 中共享一个公共子晶格。大多数高熵材料都是以烧结陶瓷形式的多晶材料生产的。哪些金属种类位于晶界的问题仍然未知。在这里，我们使用密度泛函理论（DFT）计算了五种二硼化物和HEB$_2$中四种晶界的晶界能$γ_{GB}$。 我们使用 COHP 分析了这些边界处的键合，并使用蒙特卡罗/分子动力学和针对该系统进行微调的 MACE 势，对 HEB$_2$ 的六个边界处的阳离子分离进行了采样（有序和一般）。根据我们的结果$γ_{GB}$按组划分：V族二硼化物NbB$_2$和TaB$_2$在四种GB中的三种中形成了大约IV族能量一半的边界，范围从0.8到2.7，而2.5--4.8~J/m$^2$。 COHP在费米能级上表现出显着差异，即NbB$_2$和TaB$_2$的Me--B键在费米能级($E_F$)处呈反键合，而在GB处成键，而它们的综合强度几乎没有变化。在 HEB$_2$ 中，偏析遵循类似的模式：Nb 和 Ta 在 6 个晶界中的 5 个处富集，包括一般晶界，在 2000~K 时高达 23--35~at.\\%，尽管原子的尺寸有利于扩展位点中的 Zr 和 Hf。对于 300~K 张力下的随机边界，偏析的 $Σ193$ 晶界可以承受 26 对 20~GPa 的压力。 HEB$_2$ 的晶界由 V 族金属组成，如二元化合物的边界能及其在费米能级的键合所表明的那样。 (Hf,Ta,Ti,Nb,Zr)B$_2$的晶界优先包括Nb和Ta。这降低了晶界能并强化了晶界。这包括较低的边界能量并改变 NbB$_2$ 和 TaB$_2$ 中的费米能级键合。",
      "articleSummary": "Five metals share a common sublattice in the (Hf,Ta,Ti,Nb,Zr)B$_2$ (HEB$_2$). Most high-entropy materials are produced as polycrystalline materials in the form of sintered ceramics. The question of which metal species are located at grain boundaries is still unknown. Here, we calculated the grain-boundary energy $γ_{GB}$ of four types of boundaries in five binary diborides and HEB$_2$ using density functional theory (DFT). We analyzed the bonding at these boundaries using COHP and sampled cation segregation at six boundaries of HEB$_2$, ordered and general, using Monte Carlo / molecular dynamics with a MACE potential that was fine-tuned for this system. According to our results $γ_{GB}$ splits by group: the group V diborides NbB$_2$ and TaB$_2$ form boundaries with about half the energy of the group IV at three of the four types of GBs, ranging from 0.8 to 2.7 compared to 2.5--4.8~J/m$^2$. COHP shows a significant difference at the Fermi level, namely the Me--B bonds of NbB$_2$ and TaB$_2$ are antibonding at Fermi energy ($E_F$) in the bulk but bonding at the GB, while their integrated strength hardly changes. In HEB$_2$ the segregation follows a similar pattern: Nb and Ta are enriched at five of the six grain boundaries, including general boundaries, up to 23--35~at.\\% at 2000~K, although the size of the atoms would favor Zr and Hf in the expanded sites. A segregated $Σ193$ grain boundary can withstand 26 against 20~GPa for a random boundary in tension at 300~K. The grain boundaries of HEB$_2$ are composed of group V metals, as suggested by the boundary energies of binaries compounds and their bonding at the Fermi level. Grain boundaries of the (Hf,Ta,Ti,Nb,Zr)B$_2$ preferentially include Nb and Ta. This lowers the grain boundary energy and strengthens the boundaries. This consists of the lower boundary energy and changes Fermi level bonding in NbB$_2$ and TaB$_2$.",
      "articleSummaryZh": "五种金属在 (Hf,Ta,Ti,Nb,Zr)B$_2$ (HEB$_2$) 中共享一个公共子晶格。大多数高熵材料都是以烧结陶瓷形式的多晶材料生产的。哪些金属种类位于晶界的问题仍然未知。在这里，我们使用密度泛函理论（DFT）计算了五种二硼化物和HEB$_2$中四种晶界的晶界能$γ_{GB}$。 我们使用 COHP 分析了这些边界处的键合，并使用蒙特卡罗/分子动力学和针对该系统进行微调的 MACE 势，对 HEB$_2$ 的六个边界处的阳离子分离进行了采样（有序和一般）。根据我们的结果$γ_{GB}$按组划分：V族二硼化物NbB$_2$和TaB$_2$在四种GB中的三种中形成了大约IV族能量一半的边界，范围从0.8到2.7，而2.5--4.8~J/m$^2$。 COHP在费米能级上表现出显着差异，即NbB$_2$和TaB$_2$的Me--B键在费米能级($E_F$)处呈反键合，而在GB处成键，而它们的综合强度几乎没有变化。在 HEB$_2$ 中，偏析遵循类似的模式：Nb 和 Ta 在 6 个晶界中的 5 个处富集，包括一般晶界，在 2000~K 时高达 23--35~at.\\%，尽管原子的尺寸有利于扩展位点中的 Zr 和 Hf。对于 300~K 张力下的随机边界，偏析的 $Σ193$ 晶界可以承受 26 对 20~GPa 的压力。 HEB$_2$ 的晶界由 V 族金属组成，如二元化合物的边界能及其在费米能级的键合所表明的那样。 (Hf,Ta,Ti,Nb,Zr)B$_2$的晶界优先包括Nb和Ta。这降低了晶界能并强化了晶界。这包括较低的边界能量并改变 NbB$_2$ 和 TaB$_2$ 中的费米能级键合。",
      "discussionFocus": "重点围绕 MACE potential 展开。 Most high-entropy materials are produced as polycrystalline materials in the form of sintered ceramics.",
      "discussionFocusZh": "五种金属在 (Hf,Ta,Ti,Nb,Zr)B$_2$ (HEB$_2$) 中共享一个公共子晶格。大多数高熵材料都是以烧结陶瓷形式的多晶材料生产的。 结合关键词看，阅读时应重点关注MACE 势函数相关的基准数据集、评价指标、误差来源，以及不同模型在精度、效率和可迁移性之间的取舍。"
